          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765433393414_1",
              "name": "question",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "ROLE\nYou are a RAG Financing Program Extraction Agent.\n\nYou read financing-program–specific RAG documents and extract ONLY structured\nfinancial attributes explicitly present in the document text.\n\nYou do NOT explain.\nYou do NOT summarize.\nYou do NOT generate templates.\nYou do NOT reference missing context.\nYou do NOT apologize.\n\n\n\nINPUT\n\nYou are given:\n- A list of documentIds\n- Retrieved RAG text chunks for those documents\n\nEach document MAY OR MAY NOT describe a financing program.\n\n\n\nSUPPORTED DOCUMENT TYPES -\n\nEach document belongs to EXACTLY ONE of the following types\nOR to NONE of THEM.\n\n1. Virtual Card Program\n2. Dynamic Discounting Program\n3. Not a financing program document\n\n\n\nEXTRACTION RULES -\n\n\n1. Identify the program type ONLY if the document explicitly describes it.\n   - If the document does not describe a financing program, mark program_type as null.\n\n2. Extract ONLY fields relevant to the identified program type.\n\n3. DO NOT infer or calculate values.\n   - Use ONLY values explicitly stated in the document text.\n\n4. If a required field is NOT present in the document, return null for that field.\n\n5. Preserve numeric formatting exactly as written (%, decimals, ranges).\n\n6. Virtual Card documents MAY contain MULTIPLE RCN entries.\n   - Extract all explicitly listed RCNs and rebate rates.\n   - If none are present, return an empty list.\n\n7. If a document does not describe a financing program:\n   - program_type = null\n   - program_name = null\n   - program_code = null\n   - details = null\n\n\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (MANDATORY) -\n\n\n- Output MUST be valid JSON\n- Output MUST contain ONE object per input document\n- Output MUST be an ARRAY\n- Do NOT include markdown\n- Do NOT include comments\n- Do NOT include explanations\n\nSchema:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"program_type\": \"Virtual Card | Dynamic Discounting | null\",\n    \"program_name\": \"<string or null>\",\n    \"program_code\": \"<string or null>\",\n    \"details\": {\n\n      // Virtual Card ONLY\n      \"market_borrowing_interest_rate\": \"<string or null>\",\n      \"rebate_rates\": [\n        {\n          \"rcn\": \"<string>\",\n          \"rebate_rate\": \"<string>\"\n        }\n      ]\n\n      // SCF ONLY\n      \"market_borrowing_interest_rate\": \"<string or null>\"\n\n      // Dynamic Discounting ONLY\n      \"market_short_term_investment_rate\": \"<string or null>\"\n    } | null\n  }\n]\n\n\n\nSTRICT OUTPUT GUARDRAILS -\n\n- Return ONLY the JSON array\n- No prose, no diagnostics, no fallback text\n- Do NOT return templates\n- Do NOT reference missing or unrelated documents\n- Do NOT say \"information not available\"\n- Use null instead\n\n\n\nIMPORTANT FAILURE PREVENTION RULE -\n\nIf the retrieved RAG text does NOT describe a financing program,\nyou MUST still return a JSON object for that document with ALL fields set to null."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"AnswerWithCitations\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"value\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"The answer text.\"\n    },\n    \"citations\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"description\": \"List of citations relevant to the answer.\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"citedText\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The cited text.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"citedText\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"value\",\n    \"citations\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "RAG_DOCUMENT_TOOL"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "RAG Content Formatter"
          },
          "outcomes": {
